t to go.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/26/american-airlines-group-aal-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2019-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"Fuel price increases -- increased sharply during the first quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Isom","x":"The Pacific also benefited from our network restructuring to China and our partnership with Japan Airlines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"Whereas I think the fleet restructuring is noncash and it's just bringing forward catch-up depreciation and accelerated depreciation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"Indeed when we raised our guidance a couple of weeks ago, at least a number of reports suggested while it's really -- it sounded like a cost story, that we'd done a better job of keeping our cost in checked in some expected and our revenues came out in line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/american-airlines-group-aal-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"Mike, implicit in your question, I think, is that if we didn't do that that we would be paying the tariff, yes?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"Now, look, what we know, don't think, no, that the USTR pays the tariff at the level it did to ensure that the burden didn't get borne by U.S. airlines by the French.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"But if they can't do that, again, we are certain that the goal of the USTR was not to have these tariffs paid by U.S. airlines and then passed it on to the U.S. citizens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"Pacific unit revenue also continues to show improvement aided by our China restructuring last year, with unit revenue up 1.6%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2019 Q4","e":"aal","d":"2020-01-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"In the fourth quarter, our Pacific unit revenue continued to show improvement, up 1.3% year over year, which was aided by our China restructuring last year and our partnership with Japan Airlines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/american-airlines-group-aal-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2020-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Isom","x":"And with that, I'll pass it on to Derek.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/02/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Isom","x":"We've adjusted our network to meet drastically lower levels of demand, taking swift action to rightsize our schedule with systemized capacity cuts and flight consolidations across our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/02/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"While we have done a lot to address our near-term costs, we will continue to take the necessary steps to rightsize our cost structure for the lower levels of capacity we expect in the near future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/02/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"We know we will be a smaller airline going forward, and we've worked to rightsize all aspects of the organization to that reality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/american-airlines-group-aal-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"And as Doug mentioned earlier, we just completed a 30% rightsizing of our management and support staff, resulting in annual estimated savings of more than $0.5 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/american-airlines-group-aal-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"And the concept was that the government as a pass-through, gives money to airlines to pay those people to fly those flights that we wouldn't otherwise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"To that end, we worked relentlessly to rightsize all aspects of the airline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Parker","x":"This has been done primarily through cost savings resulting from reduced flying and long term structural changes to our fleet and our infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q4","e":"aal","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"As a reminder, our definition of cash burn includes $8 million per day of regular debt principal and cash severance payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/american-airlines-group-aal-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2020 Q4","e":"aal","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"The first quarter in -- also includes approximately $9 million per day of debt principal and cash severance payments, which includes a $360 million WTC amortization, including the maturity of our 2011-1 WTC, which unencumbers 30 aircraft.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/american-airlines-group-aal-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2021 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"As a reminder, our definition of cash burn includes approximately 9 million per day of regular debt principal and cash severance payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2021 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"And excluding approximately 8 million per day of regular debt principal and cash severance payments made in March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2021 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2021-10-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"In addition to the customer benefits of larger overhead bins, in-seat power and streaming in-flight entertainment, these aircraft will generate more revenue and allow us to connect to more customers over our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2021 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Dan McKenzie","x":"The Oasis project, is that included in the $1.3 billion of structural cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/american-airlines-group-aal-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2022 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2022-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Isom","x":"And at American, we have completed a $1.3 billion cost reduction program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/21/american-airlines-group-aal-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2022 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2022-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vasu Raja","x":"…industry that has struggled for a long time to be able to pass its cost into revenue, at least for us, what we've seen time and time again with the regionals is anytime there has been a cost increase, that is the one part of the business where we can most consistently pass it through to revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/21/american-airlines-group-aal-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2022 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2022-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Derek Kerr","x":"You saw us last quarter push out some deliveries on the 789s and make sure that we rightsize those.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/21/american-airlines-group-aal-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2022 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2022-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David Vernon","x":"…going to play devil's advocate and say this isn't necessarily the case that we're thinking about, but in a world where we don't get that capacity recovery, the conversation within the company or the board around maybe restructuring that asset level, that resource level to some new level of lower.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/21/american-airlines-group-aal-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AAL 2024 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2024-10-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Devon May","x":"I think you’ll see the same types of outcomes as we invest more into Gen AI and other technologies that are going to allow us to better utilize our assets, better utilize our people and better serve our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/american-airlines-aal-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2024 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2024-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Devon May","x":"We are on track to deliver $400 million in cost savings this year with $300 million achieved through the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/american-airlines-aal-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2024 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2024-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel McKenzie","x":"And what kind of cost savings could that potentially imply?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/american-airlines-aal-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2025 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2025-07-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Isom","x":"One of the big AI investments we've made is in a project that we call heat that allows us to rebuild the operation as quickly as possible going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/american-airlines-aal-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2025 Q2","e":"aal","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Isom","x":"I think it comes from tariff deals being, you know, done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/american-airlines-aal-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2025 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2025-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Devon May","x":"We are continuing our multiyear reengineering the business effort to utilize technology and streamline processes to enable an improved customer and team member experience while driving a more efficient business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/american-airlines-aal-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2025 Q4","e":"aal","d":"2026-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Devon May","x":"A lot of the work, though, just continues to be streamlining processes and making, you know, regular way technology investments that drive improvements across our labor line with productivity improvements that are improvements for our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/american-airlines-aal-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2026 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Devon E. May","x":"I think Nat Pieper’s answer on our expectations for fuel recapture effectively already answers your question on RASM: we do expect higher yields going forward as we pass through more of the higher fuel expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/aal-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2026 Q1","e":"aal","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Gaudin","x":"I wanted to follow up on the fuel pass-through commentary and getting to a recapture rate in the 90s by the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/aal-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2026 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Atul Maheshwari","x":"Or realistically, at this point, capacity management is the major lever given all the price increases that have already been passed through by the industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/american-airlines-aal-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AAL 2026 Q3","e":"aal","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert D. Isom Jr.","x":"And in terms of the ability to hold on to that and push it further, I think the fuel price increase that we have experienced has just been a catalyst to allow us to realize that there is value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/american-airlines-aal-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[32,1,11351,0,0,0,9116,1579],[35,1,13355,0,0,0,10324,2238],[36,1,12735,0,0,0,10350,1614],[37,1,12226,0,0,0,10380,1126],[38,1,12312,0,0,0,10533,1123],[39,1,13062,0,0,0,10452,1911],[40,1,12350,0,0,0,10369,1350],[41,1,10991,0,0,0,8892,1616],[42,1,12400,0,0,0,10385,1254],[43,1,11514,0,0,0,9415,1431],[44,1,12165,0,0,0,9809,1595],[45,1,12717,0,0,0,10316,1785],[47,1,14146,0,0,0,11688,1716],[48,1,13056,0,0,0,10791,1714],[49,1,12292,0,0,0,10292,1249],[50,1,12869,0,0,0,10354,1784],[51,1,12723,0,0,0,11080,1193],[59,1,9793,0,0,0,2060,7232],[62,1,9456,0,0,0,2217,6528],[63,1,10117,0,0,0,3523,5942],[64,1,9748,0,0,0,3053,6216],[65,1,9211,0,0,0,3233,5172],[67,1,9183,0,0,0,6499,2039]],"cinema":[[32,1,11351,0,0,0,9116,1579],[35,1,13355,0,0,0,10324,2238],[36,1,12735,0,0,0,10350,1614],[37,1,12226,0,0,0,10380,1126],[38,1,12312,0,0,0,10533,1123],[39,1,13062,0,0,0,10452,1911],[40,1,12350,0,0,0,10369,1350],[41,1,10991,0,0,0,8892,1616],[42,1,12400,0,0,0,10385,1254],[43,1,11514,0,0,0,9415,1431],[44,1,12165,0,0,0,9809,1595],[45,1,12717,0,0,0,10316,1785],[47,1,14146,0,0,0,11688,1716],[48,1,13056,0,0,0,10791,1714],[49,1,12292,0,0,0,10292,1249],[50,1,12869,0,0,0,10354,1784],[51,1,12723,0,0,0,11080,1193],[59,1,9793,0,0,0,2060,7232],[62,1,9456,0,0,0,2217,6528],[63,1,10117,0,0,0,3523,5942],[64,1,9748,0,0,0,3053,6216],[65,1,9211,0,0,0,3233,5172],[67,1,9183,0,0,0,6499,2039]],"imax":[[32,1,11351,0,0,0,9116,1579],[35,1,13355,0,0,0,10324,2238],[36,1,12735,0,0,0,10350,1614],[37,1,12226,0,0,0,10380,1126],[38,1,12312,0,0,0,10533,1123],[39,1,13062,0,0,0,10